# Linear workspace for this repo

All Linear work for Sifty lives in the **sifty-demo** workspace
(https://linear.app/sifty-demo), team **SIF**.

- Always use the **`linear-sifty`** MCP server for Linear reads and writes in
  this repo. It is API-key-bound to the sifty-demo workspace and cannot drift.
- Never use a server named plain `linear` here: that is the shared demo
  team's connector and other field engineers re-point it to their own
  workspaces (tldraw-santi, Anyspherefff, ...) daily. Tickets it returns for
  this repo are the wrong project's tickets.
- If `linear-sifty` is unavailable, say so and continue without Linear rather
  than falling back to the shared server.
